  "estimatedMinutes": 2,
  "statement": "The number of triples \\((a,b,c)\\) of positive integers which satisfy the simultaneous equations \\[ \\begin{aligned} ab+bc&=44,\\\\ ac+bc&=23. \\end{aligned} \\] is",
